y, cash conversion, and competitive position with PANW.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001713683&owner=exclude"},{"name":"MICROSOFT CORP","ticker":"MSFT","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for PANW","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with PANW.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000789019&owner=exclude"},{"name":"CISCO SYSTEMS, INC.","ticker":"CSCO","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for PANW","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with PANW.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000858877&owner=exclude"},{"name":"Okta, Inc.","ticker":"OKTA","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for PANW","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with PANW.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001660134&owner=exclude"}],"sources":[{"title":"PANW SEC filing library","meta":"SEC EDGAR · Exact filer","href":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001327567&owner=exclude","excerpt":"Palo Alto Networks Inc filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports."},{"title":"PANW annual reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-K · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001327567&type=10-K&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Annual reports describe the business, segments, competition, financial statements, commitments, controls, and material risks."},{"title":"PANW quarterly reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-Q · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001327567&type=10-Q&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Quarterly filings update results, cash flow, balance-sheet items, contingencies, and management discussion."},{"title":"PANW proxy statements","meta":"SEC DEF 14A · Governance source","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001327567&type=DEF%2014A&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Proxy filings disclose board oversight, executive incentives, ownership, related matters, and shareholder proposals."},{"title":"PANW investor relations","meta":"Company primary materials","href":"https://investors.paloaltonetworks.com/","excerpt":"Official earnings releases, presentations, events, governance materials, and shareholder information published by the company."},{"title":"PANW official newsroom","meta":"Company announcements","href":"https://www.paloaltonetworks.com/company/press","excerpt":"Official operational, product, partnership, leadership, and corporate announcements; management assertions remain subject to independent verification."}]}', 'Founding editorial research', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
