VALUES ('SNDK', 'published', '{"ticker":"SNDK","reviewed":"August 2, 2026","completeness":100,"newsroomUrl":"https://newsroom.sandisk.com/","description":"Flash-memory company supplying NAND components, solid-state drives, cards, and embedded storage products.","lede":"SANDISK Corp. earns owner value through flash product sales to cloud providers, oems, distributors, retailers, and device manufacturers. The three questions that matter most are industry supply, bit demand, inventory, utilization, and price per bit, qualification, capacity points, cloud customers, mix, and gross margin, layer transitions, yield, capital sharing, bit growth, and cost per bit.","sells":"Data-center and client SSDs, NAND flash, removable cards, embedded storage, and consumer-branded storage.","revenueModel":"Flash product sales to cloud providers, OEMs, distributors, retailers, and device manufacturers.","opportunity":"AI data-center storage, enterprise SSD share, disciplined NAND supply, and higher-capacity devices can improve mix and returns.","mustGoRight":"Bit growth and pricing must balance, technology transitions must yield, and manufacturing-partner economics must remain aligned.","editorNote":"Treat the claimed advantage—nand technology, manufacturing partnerships, controller expertise, and branded channels can participate across storage tiers.—as a thesis to verify against filings, cash conversion, customer behavior, and competitor evidence rather than as an established fact.","bullTitle":"What can compound owner value","bull":["NAND technology, manufacturing partnerships, controller expertise, and branded channels can participate across storage tiers.","AI data-center storage, enterprise SSD share, disciplined NAND supply, and higher-capacity devices can improve mix and returns.","Visible progress in nand pricing and enterprise ssd can improve the durability and quality of earnings.","Disciplined reinvestment and capital allocation can convert operating progress into per-share value."],"bearTitle":"What can impair the thesis","bear":["Memory cycle can weaken the owner outcome; monitor inventory, utilization, bit supply, pricing, and demand elasticity.","Manufacturing partnership can weaken the owner outcome; monitor joint-venture terms, investment, capacity, technology, and disputes.","Technology competition can weaken the owner outcome; monitor nand roadmaps, controllers, endurance, qualification, and market share.","A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable."],"thesisBreaker":"The thesis breaks if persistent NAND oversupply and weak enterprise execution prevent the business from earning its cost of capital through cycles.","financialDrivers":[{"label":"NAND PRICING","value":"Primary owner KPI","detail":"industry supply, bit demand, inventory, utilization, and price per bit"},{"label":"ENTERPRISE SSD","value":"Primary owner KPI","detail":"qualification, capacity points, cloud customers, mix, and gross margin"},{"label":"TECHNOLOGY & COST","value":"Primary owner KPI","detail":"layer transitions, yield, capital sharing, bit growth, and cost per bit"},{"label":"BALANCE SHEET","value":"Capacity and resilience","detail":"Liquidity, debt, leases, pensions, commitments, interest cost, and refinancing exposure."},{"label":"CASH CONVERSION","value":"Earnings quality","detail":"Operating cash flow, working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, restructuring, and normalized free cash flow."},{"label":"PER-SHARE VALUE","value":"Owner conversion","detail":"Diluted shares, stock compensation, repurchases, dividends, retained earnings, and return on invested capital."}],"risks":[{"title":"Memory cycle","level":"High","text":"Memory cycle can materially reduce revenue durability, margins, cash conversion, or the value of invested capital.","signal":"inventory, utilization, bit supply, pricing, and demand elasticity"},{"title":"Manufacturing partnership","level":"High","text":"Manufacturing partnership can materially reduce revenue durability, margins, cash conversion, or the value of invested capital.","signal":"joint-venture terms, investment, capacity, technology, and disputes"},{"title":"Technology competition","level":"High","text":"Technology competition can materially reduce revenue durability, margins, cash conversion, or the value of invested capital.","signal":"NAND roadmaps, controllers, endurance, qualification, and market share"},{"title":"Capital allocation","level":"Medium","text":"Acquisitions, repurchases, dividends, debt reduction, and internal investment can create or destroy per-share value.","signal":"Return on invested capital, leverage, share count, impairment charges, and post-deal performance"},{"title":"Legal, regulatory, and reporting","level":"Medium","text":"Regulation, litigation, tax, cybersecurity, and accounting judgments can alter cash flows or constrain strategy.","signal":"Proceedings, remedies, restatements, control weaknesses, and material changes in risk-factor language"}],"monitor":[{"title":"NAND PRICING","text":"Track industry supply, bit demand, inventory, utilization, and price per bit and compare each update with management''s prior commitments.","impact":"BULL CASE"},{"title":"ENTERPRISE SSD","text":"Track qualification, capacity points, cloud customers, mix, and gross margin and compare each update with management''s prior commitments.","impact":"NEUTRAL"},{"title":"TECHNOLOGY & COST","text":"Track layer transitions, yield, capital sharing, bit growth, and cost per bit and compare each update with management''s prior commitments.","impact":"BEAR CASE"},{"title":"Quarterly thesis audit","text":"Compare each new filing with prior promises and record evidence that strengthens, weakens, or leaves the owner thesis unchanged.","impact":"NEUTRAL"}],"questions":["Which disclosed measure most reliably verifies nand pricing?","What would cause enterprise ssd to structurally improve or deteriorate?","How should owners