":"PSTG","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for SNDK","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with SNDK.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=PSTG&owner=exclude"},{"name":"SIMO","ticker":"SIMO","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for SNDK","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with SNDK.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=SIMO&owner=exclude"},{"name":"MICROCHIP TECHNOLOGY INC","ticker":"MCHP","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for SNDK","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with SNDK.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000827054&owner=exclude"}],"sources":[{"title":"SNDK SEC filing library","meta":"SEC EDGAR · Exact filer","href":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0002023554&owner=exclude","excerpt":"Sandisk Corp filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports."},{"title":"SNDK annual reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-K · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002023554&type=10-K&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Annual reports describe the business, segments, competition, financial statements, commitments, controls, and material risks."},{"title":"SNDK quarterly reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-Q · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002023554&type=10-Q&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Quarterly filings update results, cash flow, balance-sheet items, contingencies, and management discussion."},{"title":"SNDK proxy statements","meta":"SEC DEF 14A · Governance source","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0002023554&type=DEF%2014A&owner=exclude&count=40","excerpt":"Proxy filings disclose board oversight, executive incentives, ownership, related matters, and shareholder proposals."},{"title":"SNDK investor relations","meta":"Company primary materials","href":"https://investor.sandisk.com/","excerpt":"Official earnings releases, presentations, events, governance materials, and shareholder information published by the company."},{"title":"SNDK official newsroom","meta":"Company announcements","href":"https://newsroom.sandisk.com/","excerpt":"Official operational, product, partnership, leadership, and corporate announcements; management assertions remain subject to independent verification."}]}', 'Founding editorial research', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
