 with PFE.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000059478&owner=exclude"},{"name":"AbbVie Inc.","ticker":"ABBV","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for PFE","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with PFE.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001551152&owner=exclude"},{"name":"AMGEN INC","ticker":"AMGN","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for PFE","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with PFE.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000318154&owner=exclude"},{"name":"GILEAD SCIENCES, INC.","ticker":"GILD","ownership":"Public","relationship":"Operating and valuation reference for PFE","valuation":"Use current enterprise value, earnings, cash flow, and sector-appropriate multiples; normalize accounting, leverage, and capital intensity.","financialStatus":"Compare growth, margins, balance-sheet capacity, cash conversion, and competitive position with PFE.","sourceUrl":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000882095&owner=exclude"}],"sources":[{"title":"PFE SEC filing library","meta":"SEC EDGAR · Exact filer","href":"https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000078003&owner=exclude","excerpt":"PFIZER INC filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports."},{"title":"PFE annual reports","meta":"SEC Forms 10-K · Primary filings","href":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0000078003&type=10-K&owner=exclude&count=